哦，真的吗？

265
00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:48.940
Halstead told me that they had the CPR storyline for the first half of the episode.
哈尔斯特德告诉我，他们上半集准备的是心肺复苏的剧情。

266
00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.980
