00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:41.540
She eventually made her way to the 1946 Miss America pageant.
她最终闯入了1946年的美国小姐选美大赛。

333
00:12:41.840 --> 00:12:42.300
What?
什么？

334
00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:43.660
She was in the Miss America pageant.
她参加过美国小姐选美大赛。

335
00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:44.180
